      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The complaints were studied and pain syndrome estimated in 125 patients with nonspecific osteomyelitis of the spine (NOS). Complex conservative treatment was given to 74 of the patients, on 51 patients radical-restorative operations on the spine were fulfilled. The investigation has revealed specific features of pain syndrome in acute and chronic forms of NOS, in operative and conservative treatment."},
